<b>Joi Patriot Training Course 5,000 yen</b>

00:15:30.010 --> 00:15:34.490
Tickets for 5,000 yen and 10,000 
yen Joi Patriot training courses.

00:15:34.770 --> 00:15:38.070
<b>Become a Joi Patriot!!! 5,000 yen course</b>

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:37.830
The 5,000 yen course makes you 
a Joi patriot in three days.

00:15:38.070 --> 00:15:42.910
<b>Become a Joi Patriot!!! 10,000 yen course</b>

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:41.580
The 10,000 yen course is the 
same as the 5,000 yen course,

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:42.910
but you also receive 5,000 yen!

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:46.680
Then you only need to offer 
the 5,000 yen course!

00:15:46.680 --> 00:15:48.150
Gintoki!

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:51.100
Hm? It's Kyubei.

00:15:51.100 --> 00:15:53.100
Why are you in such a rush?

00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:55.890
Yes, I've been hearing stories about you.

00:15:55.890 --> 00:15:57.050
About me?

00:15:57.270 --> 00:16:02.130
Well, I heard you were 
passing out balls today.

00:16:02.130 --> 00:16:04.020
That would make me a sicko!

00:16:04.020 --> 00:16:05.740
That's not even possible!

00:16:05.740 --> 00:16:07.010
It's not like I have extra balls!

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:08.490
What? Impossible!

00:16:08.490 --> 00:16:11.530
Uh, why would you ever 
believe those stories?

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:14.330
And what would you do with those balls?

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:18.080
If I also received a rod next year, 
I'd be set for the operation.

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:19.840
I'm not handing out anything!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:23.390
And what do rods have 
to do with New Year's?!

00:16:23.390 --> 00:16:24.780
You're just being weird!

00:16:24.780 --> 00:16:26.740
Young lady!

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:29.080
Don't do it!

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:29.750
Tojo...

00:16:30.250 --> 00:16:31.550
Don't do it!

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:35.930
You must not touch his spineless balls!

00:16:35.930 --> 00:16:37.050
Balls never have spines.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:38.950
That's not what I meant!

00:16:38.950 --> 00:16:40.210
What's the problem then?

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:45.210
Everything! His dirty balls are not 
meant for a well-to-do lady like yourself!

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:47.630
Eh? Did you say my balls are dirty?

00:16:47.630 --> 00:16:49.040
They're cleaner than yours!

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:50.160
Squeaky clean!

00:16:50.160 --> 00:16:52.850
No! Mine are absolutely cleaner!

00:16:52.850 --> 00:16:56.210
Because I just visited a **** 
on the first day of the year

00:16:56.220 --> 00:16:57.770
and got them washed squeaky clean!

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:58.900
I can prove it!

00:17:02.110 --> 00:17:04.340
Hey, let's stop this.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:07.350
Obviously, nothing good happens when I 
try to hand out New Year's envelopes.

00:17:07.350 --> 00:17:09.830
I haven't even managed 
to hand one over yet.

00:17:09.830 --> 00:17:11.750
Th-That's not true.

00:17:11.970 --> 00:17:16.130
Since kids and colleagues are 
out, who does that leave?

00:17:17.630 --> 00:17:19.200
<b>New Year's envelope please.</b>

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:29.710
Hey, let's stop this.

00:17:29.710 --> 00:17:32.940
Obviously, nothing good happens when I 
try to hand out New Year's envelopes.

00:17:32.940 --> 00:17:35.540
I haven't even managed 
to hand one over yet.

00:17:35.540 --> 00:17:37.610
Th-That's not true.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:41.800
Since kids and colleagues are 
out, who does that leave?

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:43.030
<b>New Year's envelope please.</b>

00:17:49.950 --> 00:17:52.880
H-Hey, let's stop this.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:55.960
Obviously, nothing good happens when I 
try to hand out New Year's envelopes.

00:17:55.960 --> 00:17:59.950
I-I haven't even managed 
to hand one over yet.

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:00.590
<b>New Year's envelope please.</b>

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:08.340
Hey! Let's stop this!

00:18:08.340 --> 00:18:11.030
Obviously, nothing good happens when I 
try to hand out New Year's envelopes!

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:13.100
I haven't even managed 
to hand one over yet!

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:14.690
That's not true!

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:20.640
Since kids and colleagues are 
out, who does that leave?!

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:24.860
Hey, let's stop this.

00:18:24.860 --> 00:18:27.860
Obviously, nothing good happens...

00:18:30.430 --> 00:18:32.390
Happy New Year.

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:33.870
Where's the happy?!

00:18:33.870 --> 00:18:36.350
We're stuck in this dark place now!

00:18:36.350 --> 00:18:38.510
We've been trapped!

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:40.310
What did you do?!

00:18:40.310 --> 00:18:43.840
Hey! His sunglasses are 
actually pure darkness!

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:46.220
His eyes are completely dark now!

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:50.920
A new year has come, but the 
darkness hasn't left my eyes.

00:18:50.920 --> 00:18:54.330
His voice is ringing inside my head!

00:18:54.330 --> 00:18:57.250
Perfect timing, Shinpachi-kun, 
Kagura-chan.

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:59.290
I have New Year's envelopes for you.

00:18:59.290 --> 00:19:03.190
You people keep taking from me.

00:19:03.190 --> 00:19:04.090
No, it's okay!

00:19:04.090 --> 00:19:04.970
We don't need anything!

00:19:04.970 --> 00:19:06.610
There's nothing to take from you!

00:19:07.100 --> 00:19:08.950
Cardboard wing.

00:19:09.390 --> 00:19:10.860
Vinyl wing.

00:19:13.010 --> 00:19:15.460
Rip off whichever one you want.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:16.700
I can't do that!

00:19:16.700 --> 00:19:18.750
They're worthless, but I can't do that!

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:22.200
Want to see what happens if you 
rip off the cardboard wing?

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.230
I can't wait.

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:26.560
Hey, he did something funny 
to the cardboard wing!

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:28.720
But the vinyl wing is also...

00:19:29.920 --> 00:19:31.140
What's going on?!

00:19:31.140 --> 00:19:33.100
Let's give him money and get out of here!

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:34.140
Why are we even here?!

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:36.720
I'm getting sick of 
this, so can we go home?

00:19:36.720 --> 00:19:37.640
No.

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:41.450
You're not doing it right.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:43.540
Come over here.

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:45.320
Hey, did you know?

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:49.860
New Year's envelopes aren't 
only meant for kids.

00:19:50.690 --> 00:19:54.510
Welcome to the adult New Year's envelope.

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:58.790
I'll be the envelope for your rod.

00:19:59.020 --> 00:20:01.290
My envelope is open for you.

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:05.500
I'll stick this ball 
in your envelope then.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:11.180
Sorry about this.

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:13.210
You were trying to help,

00:20:13.210 --> 00:20:15.810
but I couldn't give an 
envelope to a single person.

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:19.740
I guess it's harder when 
the money isn't my own.

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:22.410
I'll give this back to you.

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:25.770
And these, too.

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:29.630
Gin-chan, what are these?

00:20:30.150 --> 00:20:31.930
It wasn't easy.

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:35.030
I spend my money so fast

00:20:35.030 --> 00:20:37.530
<b>For Shinpachi</b>

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:40.040
that I forgot where I hid my own money.

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:40.040
<b>For Kagura</b>

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:44.670
It was in my shoe.

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:49.000
I see. That's why it stinks.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:00.520
Well, now that we have money...

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:02.770
Let's go party.

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:06.930
Hey, you were complaining 
about how I spend money,

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:08.920
and now you're doing the same?

00:21:08.920 --> 00:21:13.780
That's because you share 
your soul with us everyday.

00:21:14.050 --> 00:21:16.550
Money isn't meant to be held overnight.

00:21:16.550 --> 00:21:17.790
Right on!

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:20.710
What are you idiots talking about?

00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:40.850
<b>A massage from Gin-san (one time use).</b>

00:21:40.850 --> 00:21:41.850
