<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:33.430 --> 00:23:36.840
Hey! Why are you two just lying around?!

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:40.880
What? I can't brush my teeth after 
I'm already under a kotatsu.

00:23:40.880 --> 00:23:44.930
<b>When Sleeping Under a Kotatsu, Make 
Sure You Don't Burn Your Balls</b>

00:23:41.110 --> 00:23:43.590
Man, I'm too lazy to 
read the episode title.

00:23:43.590 --> 00:23:44.930
Hey!

00:23:44.930 --> 00:23:49.940
<b>The kotatsu is an enticing trap. Once 
you're inside, you're paralyzed.</b>

00:23:49.940 --> 00:23:54.940
<b>We'll just be lying around next week. 
And don't say that we do that every week.</b>
